    "summaryLead": "I have led the AI transformation, not advised on it — and I still run one every day.",
    "summary": "I lead AI and technology transformation in organizations where it has to reach the P&amp;L, not just the roadmap. As founding CTO I took a 30,000-person retail company digital and built its 30M-member commerce platform from zero — the company went on to raise billions of RMB. As a founder I raised tens of millions of US dollars and shipped products to 1M+ users across 28 countries. Today I run a 30+ agent operation daily, and bring the same operating discipline — goals turned into owned work, review loops and reusable systems — to companies making the same shift.",
